Description: XLiquidGlass 3.0 Beta 1 for X 12.38. Keeps the existing NeoFreeBird Appearance toggle, Lucas25Pedrosa credit and Tab Bar Tint modes (Native, Active tab and All tabs), while replacing the Liquid Glass activation path with the validated pre-TabBar X 12.38 engine. The active-tab mode keeps the validated Portal/Carried coloring model. No badge, sidebar, blur, tab-label, pill/platter, legacy-host or navigation fixes.
